  "title": "Pankaj Porwal: Speaker at Headway Maritime Decarbonization Seminar",
  "summary": "Pankaj Porwal, General Manager Fleet Sustainability at Hafnia, recently participated as a panel speaker at the Maritime Decarbonizations Seminar organized by Headway Maritime. The discussion focused on how the maritime industry can translate decarbonization ambitions into practical actions across fleets and operations. Topics included operational efficiency, data-driven decision-making, crew engagement, and the role of collaboration […]",
